     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><p style=\"margin:1.2em 0px!important\">Hi all,</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:1.2em 0px!important\">I’m fitting a bunch of models inside loops, parallelizing each model fitting. I end up with a lot of “Rscript.exe”s staying open on my machine (Windows 7), each taking 31MB of memory but not doing anything (see picture below), but I suspect slowing things down. Should I have some kind of kill command after each model fitting?</p>\r\n<pre style=\"font-size:0.85em;font-family:Consolas,Inconsolata,Courier,monospace;font-size:1em;line-height:1.2em;margin:1.2em 0px\"><code style=\"font-size:0.85em;font-family:Consolas,Inconsolata,Courier,monospace;margin:0px 0.15em;padding:0px 0.3em;white-space:pre-wrap;border:1px solid rgb(234,234,234);border-top-left-radius:3px;border-top-right-radius:3px;border-bottom-right-radius:3px;border-bottom-left-radius:3px;display:inline;background-color:rgb(248,248,248);white-space:pre;overflow:auto;border-top-left-radius:3px;border-top-right-radius:3px;border-bottom-right-radius:3px;border-bottom-left-radius:3px;border:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding:0.5em 0.7em;display:block!important;display:block;padding:0.5em;color:rgb(51,51,51);background:rgb(248,248,255)\">for...\r\nfor...\r\n  ergm(..., control = control.ergm(MCMC.interval=1000,\r\n                                    parallel=3, parallel.type=&quot;SOCK&quot;))\r\n</code></pre><p style=\"margin:1.2em 0px!important\">The models are also wrapped in a <code style=\"font-size:0.85em;font-family:Consolas,Inconsolata,Courier,monospace;margin:0px 0.15em;padding:0px 0.3em;white-space:pre-wrap;border:1px solid rgb(234,234,234);border-top-left-radius:3px;border-top-right-radius:3px;border-bottom-right-radius:3px;border-bottom-left-radius:3px;display:inline;background-color:rgb(248,248,248)\">tryCatch()</code>, in case that might matter. Thanks all,</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:1.2em 0px!important\">Michael</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:1.2em 0px!important\"><a href=\"https://lh6.googleusercontent.com/-JXpaJxkX6s0/VADWLN1hMbI/AAAAAAAAKuQ/DyXx4aa1B3M/s1600/task%2Bmanager%2Brscripts.PNG\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh6.googleusercontent.com/-JXpaJxkX6s0/VADWLN1hMbI/AAAAAAAAKuQ/DyXx4aa1B3M/s1600/task%252Bmanager%252Brscripts.PNG&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792468709240000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1ENkcjYsVv7BmACWhAnkDZ\"><img src=\"https://lh6.googleusercontent.com/-JXpaJxkX6s0/VADWLN1hMbI/AAAAAAAAKuQ/DyXx4aa1B3M/s400/task%2Bmanager%2Brscripts.PNG\" border=\"0\" width=\"346\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\r\n<div title=\"MDH:SGkgYWxsLDxkaXY+PGJyPjwvZGl2PjxkaXY+SSdtIGZpdHRpbmcgYSBidW5jaCBvZiBtb2RlbHMg\r\naW5zaWRlIGxvb3BzLCBwYXJhbGxlbGl6aW5nIGVhY2ggbW9kZWwgZml0dGluZy4gSSBlbmQgdXAg\r\nd2l0aCBhIGxvdCBvZiAiUnNjcmlwdC5leGUicyBzdGF5aW5nIG9wZW4gb24gbXkgbWFjaGluZSAo\r\nV2luZG93cyA3KSwgZWFjaCB0YWtpbmcgMzFNQiBvZiBtZW1vcnkgYnV0IG5vdCBkb2luZyBhbnl0\r\naGluZyAoc2VlIHBpY3R1cmUgYmVsb3cpLCBidXQgSSBzdXNwZWN0IHNsb3dpbmcgdGhpbmdzIGRv\r\nd24uIFNob3VsZCBJIGhhdmUgc29tZSBraW5kIG9mIGtpbGwgY29tbWFuZCBhZnRlciBlYWNoIG1v\r\nZGVsIGZpdHRpbmc/PC9kaXY+PGRpdj48YnI+PC9kaXY+PGRpdj5gYGA8L2Rpdj48ZGl2PmZvci4u\r\nLjwvZGl2PjxkaXY+Zm9yLi4uPC9kaXY+PGRpdj4mbmJzcDsgZXJnbSguLi4sIGNvbnRyb2wgPSBj\r\nb250cm9sLmVyZ20oTUNNQy5pbnRlcnZhbD0xMDAwLDwvZGl2PjxkaXY+Jm5ic3A7ICZuYnNwOyAm\r\nbmJzcDsgJm5ic3A7ICZuYnNwOyAmbmJzcDsgJm5ic3A7ICZuYnNwOyAmbmJzcDsgJm5ic3A7ICZu\r\nYnNwOyAmbmJzcDsgJm5ic3A7ICZuYnNwOyAmbmJzcDsgJm5ic3A7ICZuYnNwOyAmbmJzcDsgcGFy\r\nYWxsZWw9MywgcGFyYWxsZWwudHlwZT0iU09DSyIpKTwvZGl2PjxkaXY+YGBgPC9kaXY+PGRpdj5U\r\naGUgbW9kZWxzIGFyZSBhbHNvIHdyYXBwZWQgaW4gYSBgdHJ5Q2F0Y2goKWAsIGluIGNhc2UgdGhh\r\ndCBtaWdodCBtYXR0ZXIuIFRoYW5rcyBhbGwsPC9kaXY+PGRpdj48YnI+PC9kaXY+PGRpdj5NaWNo\r\nYWVsPC9kaXY+PHAgY2xhc3M9InNlcGFyYXRvciIgc3R5bGU9InRleHQtYWxpZ246IGNlbnRlcjsg\r\nY2xlYXI6IGJvdGg7Ij48YSBpbWFnZWFuY2hvcj0iMSIgaHJlZj0iaHR0cHM6Ly9saDYuZ29vZ2xl\r\ndXNlcmNvbnRlbnQuY29tLy1KWHBhSnhrWDZzMC9WQURXTE4xaE1iSS9BQUFBQUFBQUt1US9EeVh4\r\nNGFhMUIzTS9zMTYwMC90YXNrJ